عقارية في المملكة، متخصص بتدريب وتأهيل العاملين في القطاع العقاري السعودي، ومنح الشهادات التأهيلية لممارسة الأنشطة العقارية بكفاءة عالية.\n"},{"@Culture":"en-us","#cdata-section":"The Saudi Real Estate Institute is the first educational institution, in the Kingdom, to specialize in offering courses and training programs in real estate sciences"}]},"headerBackgroundImage":{"Value":{"#cdata-section":""}},"hidePageFromNavigation":{"Value":{"#cdata-section":"1"}},"keywords":{"Value":{"#cdata-section":"[\n  \"المعهد\",\n  \"العقاري\",\n  \"المعهد العقاري\",\n  \"الهيئة العامة للعقار\",\n  \"الخدمات الالكترونية\",\n  \"Rega\"\n]"}},"pageName":{"Value":[{"@Culture":"ar-jo","#cdata-section":"المعهد العقاري السعودي"},{"@Culture":"en-us","#cdata-section":"Saudi Real Estate Institute"}]},"pageTitle":{"Value":[{"@Culture":"ar-jo","#cdata-section":"المعهد العقاري السعودي"},{"@Culture":"en-us","#cdata-section":"Saudi Real Estate Institute "}]},"serviceBrief":{"Value":[{"@Culture":"ar-jo","#cdata-section":"{\n  \"markup\": \"<p>المعهد العقاري السعودي أول كيان تعليمي متخصص في مجال العلوم العقارية في المملكة، متخصص بتدريب وتأهيل العاملين في القطاع العقاري السعودي، ومنح الشهادات التأهيلية لممارسة الأنشطة العقارية بكفاءة عالية.</p>\",\n  \"blocks\": {\n    \"contentData\": [],\n    \"settingsData\": []\n  }\n}"},{"@Culture":"en-us","#cdata-section":"{\n  \"markup\": \"<p>The Saudi Real Estate Institute is the first educational institution, in the Kingdom, to specialize in offering courses and training programs in real estate sciences. The institute’s goal is to raise the professional and performance standards of the Saudi real estate sector by training and empowering the sector’s workforce with qualified certifications to perform the real estate sector’s work functions with efficiency. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\",\n  \"blocks\": {\n    \"contentData\": [],\n    \"settingsData\": []\n  }\n}"}]},"serviceFeature":{"Value":[{"@Culture":"ar-jo","#cdata-section":"[\n  {\n    \"key\": 