alue":{"#cdata-section":"[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"8564536a-6954-4e4b-a259-17c843b9e564\",\n    \"mediaKey\": \"d748bb18-20e4-45cd-a8b8-56a9e15df937\"\n  }\n]"}},"contentItems":{"Value":{"#cdata-section":"{\n  \"layout\": {\n    \"Umbraco.BlockList\": [\n      {\n        \"contentUdi\": \"umb://element/ed65fd41dd374e55a9ac54bf0edad1a8\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"contentUdi\": \"umb://element/6195238927a44bd996ad149d9359cb66\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"contentUdi\": \"umb://element/f2f7b19b45f94fe3b0abca2e2c57f174\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"contentUdi\": \"umb://element/a57c3c1494ab42078d3ac590fe065956\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"contentData\": [\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/ed65fd41dd374e55a9ac54bf0edad1a8\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الأولى\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 21.45pt 0in 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">يؤهل المطورون العقاريون بناء على المعايير الآتية:<br>1- &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; القدرات المالية.<br>2- &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; القدرات الفنية.<br>3- &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; القدرات المؤسسية والموارد البشرية.</p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      },\n      \"header\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/6195238927a44bd996ad149d9359cb66\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثانية\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 21.45pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">يجتاز المطور العقاري التأهيل بعد حصوله على الدرجة وفق الآتي:</p>\\n<div>\\n<table bor