rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><strong>المرة الثالثة</strong></p>\\n</td>\\n<td width=\\\"139\\\" style=\\\"width: 104.25pt; border: double windowtext 1.5pt; border-right: none; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F4E79; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 44.75pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 90%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><strong>ملاحظات</strong></p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr style=\\\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\\\">\\n<td width=\\\"57\\\" style=\\\"width: 42.4pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: double windowtext 1.5pt; border-right: double windowtext 1.5pt; mso-border-top-alt: double windowtext 1.5pt; mso-border-alt: double windowtext 1.5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8496B0; mso-background-themecolor: text2; mso-background-themetint: 153; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 8.0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 90%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><strong><span>1</span></strong></p>\\n</td>\\n<td colspan=\\\"6\\\" width=\\\"663\\\" style=\\\"width: 497.6pt; border-top: none; border-left: double windowtext 1.5pt; border-bottom: double windowtext 1.5pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: double windowtext 1.5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8496B0; mso-background-themecolor: text2; mso-background-themetint: 153; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 8.0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 90%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><strong>مخالفات الترخيص</strong></p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; height: 45.05pt;\\\">\\n<td rowspan=\\\"3\\\" width=\\\"57\\\" style=\\\"width: 42.4pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: double windowtext 1.5pt; border-right: double windowtext 1.5pt; mso-border-top-alt: double windowtext 1.5pt; mso-border-alt: double windowtext 1.5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 45.05pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 2.0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 90%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><span>1 ، 1</span></p>\\n</td>\\n<td rowspan=\\\"3\\\" width=\\\"166\\\" style=\\\"width: 124.85pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: double windowtext 1.5pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: double 1.5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: double 1.5pt; mso-border-color-alt: windowtext; background: #F2F2F2; mso-background-themecolor: background1; mso-background-themeshade: 242; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 45.05pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 2.0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 90%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 90%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">ممارسة نشاط الوساطة العقارية أو الخدمات العقارية دون الحصول على ترخيص ساري المفعول.</span></p>\\n</td>\\n<td width=\\\"82\\\" style=\\\"width: 61.8pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: double windowtext 1.5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #BDD6EE; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; heig